{"k":{"t01-apar-0":"<span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"12.6pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">AIŠKINAMOJI KNYGELĖ</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"8.4pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">PRIE</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.6pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Delmo pagalbinių lentelių</span> <span class=\"orn\">❦</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"13.2pt\" data-rolo=\"serio\">PIRMOJI SERIJA</span> <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t01-apar-1":"<span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.0pt\" data-rolo=\"nom\">LENTELĖ Nr. 1</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"11.4pt\" data-rolo=\"tit\">Mokykla. — Licėjus. — Klasė.</span> <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t01-tit-1":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Bendrasis aprašymas.</span>","t01-01-1":"1. — Ši lentelė vaizduoja <b>klasę</b> <b>licėjuje</b>. Šioje klasėje yra aštuoni <b>stalai</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.339325,0.560105,0.009987,0.010154\" data-n=\"18\" title=\"stalai\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(18)</sup></button> ir aštuoni <b>suolai</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.298491,0.886341,0.009543,0.012447\" data-n=\"32\" title=\"suolai\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(32)</sup></button>. Kiekviename suole sėdi trys mokiniai. <b>Mokytojas</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.104527,0.503767,0.004882,0.010481\" data-n=\"7\" title=\"Mokytojas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(7)</sup></button> sėdi ant <b>kėdės</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.072792,0.542745,0.00466,0.012119\" data-n=\"8\" title=\"kėdės\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(8)</sup></button> savo <b>katedroje</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.134043,0.602358,0.00466,0.011137\" data-n=\"6\" title=\"katedroje\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(6)</sup></button>.","t01-02-1":"2. — Kairėje nuo katedros stovi <b>stiklinė spinta</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.188859,0.618736,0.008877,0.010481\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"stiklinė spinta\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button>. Dešinėje yra <b>juoda lenta</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.016644,0.59679,0.003329,0.010481\" data-n=\"1\" title=\"juoda lenta\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(1)</sup></button> su savo <b>šluoste</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.034842,0.685228,0.005548,0.010154\" data-n=\"2\" title=\"šluoste\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(2)</sup></button> ir <b>kreida</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.055704,0.744186,0.004882,0.010481\" data-n=\"3\" title=\"kreida\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(3)</sup></button>.","t01-02-2":"Virš katedros kabo <b>sieninės lentelės</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.042166,0.4887,0.00466,0.010481\" data-n=\"9\" title=\"sieninės lentelės\" aria-expanded=\"false\">9</button>, <button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.097426,0.279725,0.007767,0.010481\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"sieninės lentelės\" aria-expanded=\"false\">11</button>, <button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.170883,0.311824,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"sieninės lentelės\" aria-expanded=\"false\">12</button>)</sup> ir <b>žemėlapis</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.117843,0.250901,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"10\" title=\"žemėlapis\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(10)</sup></button>.","t01-03-1":"3. — Ne visi mokiniai sėdi savo <b>vietoje</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.290945,0.528005,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"17\" title=\"vietoje\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(17)</sup></button>. Jonas <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.006658,0.712414,0.00577,0.010481\" data-n=\"4\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(4)</sup></button> stovi prie lentos; jis laiko <b>tą</b> šluostę ir trina <b>geometrines figūras.</b>","t01-03-2":"Petras yra prie katedros; jis renka <b>rašto darbus</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.092543,0.64756,0.005104,0.010809\" data-n=\"5\" title=\"rašto darbus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(5)</sup></button> ir neša juos mokytojui.","t01-04-1":"4. — <b>Šis</b> mokytojas yra <b>gyvųjų kalbų</b> mokytojas. Jis moko mokinius kalbėti, skaityti ir rašyti svetimomis kalbomis <b>(vokiškai, angliškai, ispaniškai, itališkai, rusiškai</b> arba <b>prancūziškai)</b>.","t01-05-1":"5. — Klasė labai erdvi ir labai šviesi. Gale yra platus <b>langas</b> su dviem <b>langinėmis</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.336662,0.236489,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"78\" title=\"langinėmis\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(78)</sup></button> ir <b>stiklinės durys,</b> kad ją būtų galima vėdinti ir apšviesti.","t01-05-2":"Šioje klasėje nešalta. Viduryje, kad ją šildytų, stovi labai gera <b>krosnis</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.543054,0.73567,0.011984,0.010809\" data-n=\"46\" title=\"krosnis\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(46)</sup></button> su savo <b>vamzdžiu</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.506214,0.622666,0.010431,0.011464\" data-n=\"45\" title=\"vamzdžiu\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(45)</sup></button>.","t01-05-3":"Prie sienos pritvirtintos <b>pakabos</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.908566,0.720275,0.009543,0.011464\" data-n=\"58\" title=\"pakabos\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(58)</sup></button>; ant jų kabo moksleivių kepurės ir paltai.","t01-tit-2":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Žaidimų kiemas.</span>","t01-06-1":"6. — <b>Laikrodis</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.781846,0.21225,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"63\" title=\"Laikrodis\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(63)</sup></button> rodo devynias valandas ir penkias minutes.","t01-06-2":"<b>Pertrauka</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.38016,0.384212,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"76\" title=\"Pertrauka\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(76)</sup></button> ką tik pasibaigė ir pamoka prasideda iš naujo. Pertraukos vieta yra <b>kieme</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.36285,0.442516,0.008655,0.010154\" data-n=\"75\" title=\"kieme\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(75)</sup></button>. Matome kelis mokinius, kurie žaidžia. <b>Prižiūrėtojas</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.419441,0.372093,0.011318,0.010481\" data-n=\"74\" title=\"Prižiūrėtojas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(74)</sup></button> juos stebi.","t01-07-1":"7. — Kieme dar matome įvairius asmenis, būtent <b>inspektorių</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.400355,0.432689,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"73\" title=\"inspektorių\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(73)</sup></button>, mokyklos vedėją (<b>licėjaus direktorių</b>) <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.47692,0.431379,0.008655,0.010809\" data-n=\"71\" title=\"(liceestro)\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(71)</sup></button> ir <b>cenzorių</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.441411,0.428431,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"72\" title=\"cenzorių\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(72)</sup></button>.","t01-07-2":"Inspektorius tikrina mokyklas, licėjaus direktorius vadovauja licėjui, cenzorius prižiūri mokslus.","t01-07-3":"Ketvirtasis asmuo yra <b>durininkas</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.33644,0.429414,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"77\" title=\"durininkas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(77)</sup></button>. Jis neša po pažastimi žurnalą, kad įrašytų neatvykusius.","t01-08-1":"8. — Kiemo gale yra <b>gimnastikos įrenginiai</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.467599,0.393384,0.009543,0.009826\" data-n=\"70\" title=\"gimnastikos įrenginiai\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(70)</sup></button> ir dirbtuvė <b>rankų darbams</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.559698,0.471995,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"69\" title=\"rankų darbams\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(69)</sup></button>.","t01-08-2":"Dešinėje nuo lentelės pastebime <b>muzikos</b> ir <b>piešimo</b> <b>klases</b>.","t01-tit-3":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Išsamusis aprašymas.</span>","t01-tit-4":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Gerieji mokiniai.</span>","t01-09-1":"9. — Mokiniai pirmame suole dešinėje nuo katedros yra <b>Henrikas</b> <button class=\"apel\" data-noto=\"lt-t01-noto-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\">(*)</button>, <b>Steponas</b> ir <b>Karolis.</b>","t01-09-2":"Henrikas labai dėmesingas ir darbštus; jis klauso mokytojo. Ant savo stalo jis turi <b>sąsiuvinį</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.230581,0.868981,0.010209,0.011464\" data-n=\"28\" title=\"sąsiuvinį\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(28)</sup></button>, <b>knygą</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.199068,0.863085,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"29\" title=\"knygą\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(29)</sup></button>, <b>žodyną</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.159565,0.891582,0.010874,0.011137\" data-n=\"30\" title=\"žodyną\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(30)</sup></button> ir <b>penalą</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.214603,0.905011,0.009543,0.011137\" data-n=\"31\" title=\"penalą\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(31)</sup></button>. Jo knyga turi daug <b>puslapių</b>; kiekviename skyriuje yra keletas <b>pastraipų</b>, o kiekvienoje <b>eilutėje</b> daug <b>žodžių.</b>","t01-09-4":"Jo kaimynas Steponas <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.291389,0.81035,0.012206,0.010154\" data-n=\"24\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(24)</sup></button> yra uolus. Jis užsirašo į sąsiuvinį kitos pamokos užduotį. Jis turi gražią <b>rašyseną.</b> Jo knyga uždaryta. Matome tik <b>viršelį</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.201287,0.804455,0.010431,0.010809\" data-n=\"27\" title=\"viršelį\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(27)</sup></button>. Šalia jo guli jo <b>skriestuvas</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.21771,0.820832,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"26\" title=\"skriestuvas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(26)</sup></button>.","t01-09-5":"Karolis <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.270084,0.730102,0.009987,0.011137\" data-n=\"23\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(23)</sup></button> laiko ranka savo knygą; jis ją atverčia, kad dar kartą perskaitytų savo pamoką. Jis turi, kaip ir kiekvienas mokinys, prieš save <b>rašalinę</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.241456,0.717982,0.011318,0.009826\" data-n=\"25\" title=\"rašalinę\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(25)</sup></button>. Jis klusnus.","t01-10-1":"10. — Prie gretimo stalo sėdi <b>Liudvikas, Antanas</b> ir <b>Paulius.</b> Liudvikas atsakinėja savo <b>pamoką</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.365291,0.645922,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"22\" title=\"pamoką\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(22)</sup></button> ir atsako į mokytojo <b>klausimus.</b> Antanas <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.329117,0.630855,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"21\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(21)</sup></button> labai nedėmesingas, kartais mokytojas jį net nubaudžia. Paulius <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.334665,0.600721,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"20\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(20)</sup></button> yra geras <b>draugas,</b> malonus ir paslaugus. Jis labai dėmesingas.","t01-tit-5":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Blogieji mokiniai.</span>","t01-11-1":"11. — Už Henriko sėdi <b>Jurgis</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.543276,0.87455,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"38\" title=\"Jurgis\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(38)</sup></button>. Jis nėra blogas vaikinas, bet yra <b>plepus,</b> nedėmesingas ir neramus. Jo <b>lengvabūdiškumas</b> ir <b>nepaklusnumas</b> kelia <b>sumaištį</b> per pamoką, ir dažnai jis nusipelno griežto <b>įspėjimo.</b> Jo <b>juodraštinis sąsiuvinis</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.486906,0.885686,0.009987,0.010809\" data-n=\"35\" title=\"juodraštinis sąsiuvinis\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(35)</sup></button> nešvarus, jis <b>aptaško jį rašalu</b> savo <b>plunksna</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.513316,0.936456,0.011762,0.008516\" data-n=\"34\" title=\"plunksna\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(34)</sup></button>, todėl nuolat naudoja savo <b>trintuką</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.478695,0.859155,0.010874,0.011137\" data-n=\"36\" title=\"trintuką\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(36)</sup></button>; jo <b>portfelis</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.454949,0.912217,0.010431,0.012119\" data-n=\"33\" title=\"portfelis\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(33)</sup></button> suplyšęs, nes jis labai aplaidus. Kodėl jis nešiojasi savo <b>pieštuko laikiklį</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.496671,0.864723,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"37\" title=\"pieštuko laikiklį\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(37)</sup></button> į <b>gyvųjų</b> kalbų klasę?","t01-11-2":"Jo kaimynas Edmundas <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.53573,0.800852,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"39\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(39)</sup></button> jo nemėgsta. Jis tiesa kiek tingus, bet tylus ir ramus. Jis neplepa; užuot klausęs, verčiau skaito <b>apsakymus</b> iš savo <b>skaitinių knygos.</b>","t01-11-3":"Trečiasis šio suolo mokinys yra <b>Liudvikas</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.483577,0.767114,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"40\" title=\"Liudvikas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(40)</sup></button>. Jis stropus. Rašo ant balto <b>popieriaus lapo.</b> Prieš save jis pasidėjo savo <b>sugeriamąjį popierių</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.432091,0.739928,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"41\" title=\"sugeriamąjį popierių\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(41)</sup></button>.","t01-12-1":"12. — Antrojo suolo mokiniai, kairėje nuo mokytojo, labai jauni. Pirmasis, mažasis <b>Emilis,</b> dar nemoka labai gerai rašyti; jis nešiojasi savo <b>grifelinę lentelę</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.45162,0.655421,0.011318,0.010481\" data-n=\"42\" title=\"grifelinę lentelę\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(42)</sup></button>, savo <b>grifelį</b> ir savo <b>kempinėlę</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.437195,0.627252,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"43\" title=\"kempinėlę\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(43)</sup></button>.","t01-12-2":"Šalia jo yra <b>Augustas</b> ir <b>Bernardas</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.437195,0.591549,0.011984,0.009499\" data-n=\"44\" title=\"Bernardas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(44)</sup></button>. Šis pastarasis gerai dirba, bet jo <b>apranga</b> labai apleista.","t01-13-1":"13. — Už jų sėdi trys <b>tinginiai. Albertas</b> nesimoko savo pamokų. <b>Jokūbas</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.629161,0.611857,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"47\" title=\"Jokūbas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(47)</sup></button> miega užuot klausęs. Jo <b>tingumas</b> užtraukia jam <b>priekaištų</b> ir net <b>bausmių.</b> Galiausiai <b>Kristijonas</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.679982,0.61153,0.009987,0.010154\" data-n=\"48\" title=\"Kristijonas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(48)</sup></button> per daug nerimtas. Jis blogai <b>elgiasi</b> ir nė kiek nesistengia pasitaisyti.","t01-14-1":"14. — Jo kaimynai, priešingai, elgiasi gerai. <b>Ernestas</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.699956,0.702588,0.007989,0.010809\" data-n=\"51\" title=\"Ernestas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(51)</sup></button> mėgsta tvarką ir taisyklingumą; jis nuolat naudoja savo <b>liniuotę</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.692632,0.793318,0.008877,0.010809\" data-n=\"50\" title=\"liniuotę\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(50)</sup></button> ir savo <b>pieštuką</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.671993,0.744841,0.010209,0.009171\" data-n=\"49\" title=\"pieštuką\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(49)</sup></button>. Jis yra <b>eksternas.</b>","t01-14-2":"<b>Pranciškus</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.780293,0.754012,0.009543,0.011137\" data-n=\"52\" title=\"Pranciškus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(52)</sup></button> yra <b>internas</b>; jis vilki uniformą, valgo ir miega licėjuje. Jis geras <b>draugas.</b>","t01-14-3":"Mauricijus drožia savo <b>pieštuką</b> savo <b>peiliuku</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.786951,0.886341,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"56\" title=\"peiliuku\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(56)</sup></button>; jis labai rūpestingas.","t01-14-4":"Jis nešiojasi visas savo knygas, savo <b>gramatiką</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.732801,0.892892,0.009543,0.010481\" data-n=\"55\" title=\"gramatiką\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(55)</sup></button>, savo <b>užrašų knygelę</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.709055,0.857845,0.011096,0.010481\" data-n=\"54\" title=\"užrašų knygelę\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(54)</sup></button> ir net <b>rašymo pagalvėlę</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.762761,0.880118,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"53\" title=\"rašymo pagalvėlę\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(53)</sup></button>. Jo <b>mokyklinis krepšys</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.930537,0.91451,0.010209,0.010809\" data-n=\"57\" title=\"mokyklinis krepšys\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(57)</sup></button> guli ant grindų už jo.","t01-14-5":"Du stalus klasės gale užima <b>gerieji mokiniai</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.337772,0.507042,0.008433,0.010809\" data-n=\"19\" title=\"gerieji mokiniai\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(19)</sup></button>.","t01-tit-6":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Piešimas ir muzika.</span>","t01-15-1":"15. — <b>Piešimo klasėje</b> ant sienos kabo dailūs <b>pavyzdžiai</b>, o nuo lubų nuleista <b>lempa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.975144,0.45922,0.009765,0.010809\" data-n=\"62\" title=\"lempa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(62)</sup></button> su <b>gaubtu</b>. <b>Mokytojas</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.81447,0.575827,0.009543,0.011464\" data-n=\"60\" title=\"Mokytojas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(60)</sup></button> labai kantrus; jis taiso mokinių <b>piešinius</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.891034,0.610219,0.007324,0.009826\" data-n=\"61\" title=\"piešinius\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(61)</sup></button> ir moko juos piešti <b>biustą</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.976476,0.514248,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"59\" title=\"biustą\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(59)</sup></button> iš natūros.","t01-16-1":"16. — <b>Muzikos klasė</b> atrodo labai įdomi. Joje mokomasi skaityti <b>natas,</b> solfedžiuoti <b>gamos garsus</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.753884,0.423845,0.011096,0.010481\" data-n=\"67\" title=\"gamos garsus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(67)</sup></button>, užrašytus <b>penklinėje</b> (do, re, mi, fa, sol, la, si = C. D. E. F. G. A. B.), pažinti <b>raktus</b> ir dainuoti žavias <b>melodijas.</b> Natos dedamos ant <b>pulto</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.640257,0.466099,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"65\" title=\"pulto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(65)</sup></button>. Vienas iš mokinių <b>skambina pianinu</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.758766,0.510645,0.010652,0.010809\" data-n=\"64\" title=\"skambina pianinu\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(64)</sup></button>, o <b>muzikos mokytojas</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.699512,0.461513,0.009099,0.010809\" data-n=\"66\" title=\"muzikos mokytojas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(66)</sup></button> <b>muša taktą</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.725477,0.447101,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"68\" title=\"muša taktą\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(68)</sup></button>.","t01-17-1":"17. — Pastebime <b>rankų darbų</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.559698,0.471995,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"69\" title=\"rankų darbams\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(69)</sup></button> <b>dirbtuvės</b> kampą, kur berniukai gali mokytis obliuoti medį ir dildyti geležį. To yra ne kiekviename licėjuje.","t01-tit-7":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Gamtos mokslų klasė.</span>","t01-18-1":"18. — Matematikos mokytojas moko <b>mokinius</b> <b>geometrijos, aritmetikos, skaičiavimo</b> ir <b>metrinės sistemos</b>. Lentelėje matome pagrindines geometrines figūras: <b>apskritimą</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.019633,0.658661,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"apskritimą\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, <b>kvadratą</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.052468,0.626557,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"kvadratą\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button>, <b>trikampį</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.049811,0.67077,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"trikampį\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button>, <b>tiesę</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.035173,0.739874,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"tiesę\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>.","t01-18-2":"Taip pat matome vieną <b>veiksmą;</b> tai nėra nei <b>sudėtis,</b> nei <b>atimtis,</b> nei <b>daugyba</b>: tai iš tiesų <b>dalyba</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.065565,0.676005,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"dalyba\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>.","t01-19-1":"19. — Metrinės sistemos lentelėje matome: <b>metrą</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.052217,0.380286,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"metrą\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, <b>svarstykles</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.015161,0.379639,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"svarstykles\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button> ir jų <b>svarsčius,</b> <b>litrą</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.059978,0.343932,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"litrą\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>, <b>dekalitrą</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.013372,0.258796,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"f\" title=\"dekalitrą\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(f)</sup></button>, <b>decilitrą</b> ir <b>kubinį metrą</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.03224,0.324944,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"kubinį metrą\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>.","t01-19-2":"Mokiniai taip pat mokosi <b>gamtos mokslų</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.097426,0.279725,0.007767,0.010481\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"sieninės lentelės\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(11)</sup></button>, zoologijos <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.124098,0.290533,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"zoologijos\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, botanikos <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.132317,0.3652,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"botanikos\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button>, geologijos <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.127443,0.431354,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"geologijos\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button> ir <b>istorijos</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.170883,0.311824,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"sieninės lentelės\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(12)</sup></button>.","t01-19-3":"Spintoje yra <b>fizikos</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.188859,0.618736,0.008877,0.010481\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"stiklinė spinta\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button> ir <b>chemijos</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.230138,0.5755,0.009321,0.010481\" data-n=\"16\" title=\"chemijos\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(16)</sup></button> prietaisai.","t01-19-4":"Ant spintos yra: <b>rutulys</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.189525,0.419915,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"14\" title=\"rutulys\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(14)</sup></button>, <b>kūgis</b> ir <b>Žemės rutulys</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.175322,0.387815,0.010209,0.011464\" data-n=\"13\" title=\"Žemės rutulys\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(13)</sup></button>.","t01-19-5":"Virš lentelių kabo <b>žemėlapis,</b> vaizduojantis penkias pasaulio dalis: <b>Europą</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.161802,0.143808,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"Europą\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>, <b>Aziją</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.20951,0.166394,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"g\" title=\"Aziją\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(g)</sup></button>, <b>Afriką</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.155821,0.230267,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"f\" title=\"Afriką\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(f)</sup></button>, <b>Ameriką</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.073486,0.101258,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"Ameriką\" aria-expanded=\"false\">a</button><button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.084585,0.148741,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"Ameriką\" aria-expanded=\"false\">b</button>)</sup> ir <b>Okeaniją</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.209077,0.256781,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"h\" title=\"Okeaniją\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(h)</sup></button>, ir du didžiuosius vandenynus — <b>Ramųjį</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.036213,0.146461,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"Ramųjį\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button> ir <b>Atlanto</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.116538,0.161832,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"Atlanto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>. <span class=\"fil\"></span>"},"noto":{"t01-noto-1":"(*) <i>Krikšto vardus</i> taip pat patariama perrašyti lotyniška forma. Tai vienintelis būdas išvengti nesuskaičiuojamų skirtybių. Beje, kaip pasirinkti tarp <i>Giovanni, Jean, Johann, Jan, Hans, John, Ivan</i> ir t. t.? Ar kursime atskirą krikšto vardų žodyną? Imkime iš lotynų kalbos jų vardininką ir sakykime: <b>Ioannes, Ioanna; Iulius, Iulia; Iakobus; Andreas; Lukas.</b> (Išsamioji gramatika)."}}
